1
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:11,220
Pond.

2
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:12,460
Yes, P'?

3
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:14,820
Pond, come explain this part of the work to me.

4
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:17,340
Ah, yes.

5
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:25,920
Yes, sir.

6
00:00:25,920 --> 00:00:26,640
Which part?

7
00:00:46,220 --> 00:00:49,220
What are you smirking at, P'Best?

8
00:02:13,040 --> 00:02:14,220
Are you gonna keep staring at me for much longer?

9
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:19,020
Thought you didn't notice I was watching.

10
00:02:20,200 --> 00:02:21,220
You were staring at me like that.

11
00:02:21,220 --> 00:02:22,640
How could I not notice?

12
00:02:24,460 --> 00:02:26,700
Why are you working on your day off anyway?

13
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:28,600
I just want to get it finished.

14
00:02:28,940 --> 00:02:30,620
Want to turn it in on Monday.

15
00:02:31,040 --> 00:02:33,380
Normally, my day off...

16
00:02:33,380 --> 00:02:34,800
is for resting.

17
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:36,320
Not sitting around working like this.

18
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:39,560
If you wanna rest, go rest. I don't mind.

19
00:02:39,900 --> 00:02:41,500
But I mind.

20
00:02:44,840 --> 00:02:46,520
Take a break, P'.

21
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:49,740
Let's do something...

22
00:02:49,740 --> 00:02:52,000
to help relax your brain.

23
00:02:53,380 --> 00:02:54,620
Let me tell you straight.

24
00:02:55,080 --> 00:02:56,380
Staying here with you doesn't mean...

25
00:02:56,380 --> 00:02:57,820
I want to be close to you.

26
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:00,160
If you don't feel anything...

27
00:03:01,220 --> 00:03:02,660
no matter how close we are...

28
00:03:02,960 --> 00:03:03,780
it shouldn't matter, P'.

29
00:03:05,940 --> 00:03:07,880
I just told you I don't want to be close.

30
00:03:10,200 --> 00:03:12,420
When my condo is ready, I'll definitely leave.

31
00:03:12,420 --> 00:03:13,480
Won't bother you.

32
00:03:14,480 --> 00:03:16,500
And who said you were bothering me?

33
00:03:18,220 --> 00:03:19,940
But since you're in my room...

34
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:22,920
you should make yourself useful.

35
00:03:25,140 --> 00:03:26,920
I'm not asking for much.

36
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:28,700
Just help me...

37
00:03:28,700 --> 00:03:31,020
clean up the room a little bit.

38
00:03:33,040 --> 00:03:34,920
Fine, I'll clean the whole room myself.

39
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:36,960
I said let's do it together.

40
00:03:36,960 --> 00:03:38,040
So let's do it together.

41
00:03:39,300 --> 00:03:40,300
Just like you...

42
00:03:40,300 --> 00:03:41,580
used to teach me, right?

43
00:03:42,860 --> 00:03:44,180
You were the one who taught me yourself.

44
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:49,940
Yeah.

45
00:03:54,720 --> 00:03:55,640
Yeah.

46
00:03:58,360 --> 00:03:59,320
You go first.

47
00:04:00,180 --> 00:04:02,160
Come on, help me clean. Break time's over!

48
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:04,060
No more working, get up already.

49
00:04:04,760 --> 00:04:06,680
Here, hold this.

50
00:04:34,460 --> 00:04:35,500
Oops! / Oops!

51
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:37,160
Oh, you scared me!

52
00:04:38,520 --> 00:04:39,780
You really startled me, P'.

53
00:04:39,780 --> 00:04:40,740
How'd you get in, Tontae?

54
00:04:40,740 --> 00:04:41,360
Oh.

55
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:42,880
I wasn't thinking.

56
00:04:42,880 --> 00:04:44,260
Thought nobody was in the room.

57
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:45,780
Ah.

58
00:04:46,180 --> 00:04:47,480
Actually, P'Best...

59
00:04:47,480 --> 00:04:48,880
today the housekeeper...

60
00:04:48,880 --> 00:04:50,540
is coming to clean here.

61
00:04:51,580 --> 00:04:52,560
That's bad.

62
00:04:52,560 --> 00:04:54,520
I completely forgot to tell you.

63
00:04:55,240 --> 00:04:56,860
Hey, how could you forget to tell me?

64
00:04:58,620 --> 00:05:00,260
The housekeeper is coming to clean?

65
00:05:00,500 --> 00:05:01,500
Yes.

66
00:05:01,740 --> 00:05:02,420
Oh.

67
00:05:03,940 --> 00:05:05,020
Uh...

68
00:05:05,760 --> 00:05:07,480
Yes, the room is a bit messy.

69
00:05:07,480 --> 00:05:08,680
So... / Yeah.

70
00:05:09,080 --> 00:05:10,740
How about this?

71
00:05:10,740 --> 00:05:13,180
There's a cafe and a coffee shop...

72
00:05:13,180 --> 00:05:15,040
cute little place nearby.

73
00:05:15,260 --> 00:05:16,840
Why don't you go work there, P'?

74
00:05:16,840 --> 00:05:19,500
In case you get stressed and your blood sugar drops,

75
00:05:19,500 --> 00:05:22,400
you can get some sweets and boost your sugar.

76
00:05:23,200 --> 00:05:23,800
Wanna go?

77
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:26,360
Ah.

78
00:05:27,880 --> 00:05:28,820
Okay.

79
00:05:32,220 --> 00:05:33,120
If we're going...

80
00:05:33,120 --> 00:05:34,420
shall we go together now?

81
00:05:35,360 --> 00:05:36,300
"We"?

82
00:05:36,300 --> 00:05:37,520
Yes, us.

83
00:05:37,520 --> 00:05:39,520
I actually had plans with P'Dan,

84
00:05:39,520 --> 00:05:41,400
but it looks like P'Dan is busy.

85
00:05:41,700 --> 00:05:43,340
Since you're going anyway...

86
00:05:44,900 --> 00:05:46,040
shall we go together?

87
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:48,720
Ah.

88
00:05:49,460 --> 00:05:52,160
Sure. Let me pack my things first.

89
00:05:52,460 --> 00:05:53,800
Okay.

90
00:05:55,020 --> 00:05:56,060
Need help with anything?

91
00:05:56,060 --> 00:05:57,380
It's fine.

92
00:05:57,860 --> 00:05:59,440
Just packing a few things.

93
00:05:59,440 --> 00:06:00,080
Alright.

94
00:06:03,960 --> 00:06:05,180
You really don't need help?

95
00:06:05,400 --> 00:06:07,000
Yeah, just a laptop, headphones,

96
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:08,480
and a few books.

97
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:09,300
Got it.

98
00:06:09,960 --> 00:06:11,200
I'll wait right here.

99
00:06:28,720 --> 00:06:29,660
Staring like that...

100
00:06:29,940 --> 00:06:30,920
What is this about?

101
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:35,320
Nothing, P'.

102
00:06:35,320 --> 00:06:36,480
I just wanted to say...

103
00:06:37,080 --> 00:06:38,120
this dish of mine...

104
00:06:39,320 --> 00:06:41,320
is really delicious.

105
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:45,720
Is it delicious?

106
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:48,000
Then...

107
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:48,860
can I taste it?

108
00:06:52,240 --> 00:06:53,380
Here, taste this one.

109
00:06:54,440 --> 00:06:55,620
The one on the spoon.

110
00:06:57,080 --> 00:06:57,740
Sure.

111
00:07:05,300 --> 00:07:06,620
If you get this close...

112
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:08,880
I won't call you "P'" anymore.

113
00:07:11,240 --> 00:07:12,300
If you don't call me "P'"...

114
00:07:13,920 --> 00:07:15,020
then what will you call me? "You"?

115
00:07:16,200 --> 00:07:16,880
Can I, P'?

116
00:07:16,880 --> 00:07:18,700
So we can seem more friendly.

117
00:07:18,700 --> 00:07:19,740
Y... ou...

118
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:21,280
"P'" is still better.

119
00:07:23,500 --> 00:07:24,600
Give it a try, P'.

120
00:07:27,680 --> 00:07:28,360
Mmm.

121
00:07:28,700 --> 00:07:29,180
It's good.

122
00:07:29,180 --> 00:07:29,740
Right?

123
00:07:32,160 --> 00:07:33,060
This is good too.

124
00:07:33,060 --> 00:07:33,620
Yeah.

125
00:07:33,620 --> 00:07:34,660
Want to try my egg?

126
00:07:35,260 --> 00:07:35,860
It's tasty.

127
00:07:35,860 --> 00:07:37,340
It's good too, I just ate a piece.

128
00:07:37,340 --> 00:07:38,880
Everything here is delicious.

129
00:07:46,520 --> 00:07:47,800
The egg is really firm.

130
00:07:48,720 --> 00:07:50,440
Yes, it's a boiled egg.

131
00:07:50,440 --> 00:07:52,280
Boiled in hot water, so it's cooked.

132
00:08:10,960 --> 00:08:11,980
P'Dan, P'...

133
00:08:13,080 --> 00:08:15,480
help me check this part. I don't get it.

134
00:08:16,840 --> 00:08:17,600
Oh.

135
00:08:18,280 --> 00:08:19,340
Which part?

136
00:08:19,340 --> 00:08:20,140
Right here.

137
00:08:21,660 --> 00:08:21,900
Uh...

138
00:08:22,240 --> 00:08:23,180
Sit down.

139
00:08:26,960 --> 00:08:27,940
Where was it?

140
00:08:27,940 --> 00:08:29,140
Right here.

141
00:08:29,600 --> 00:08:31,560
Don't know how it connects to this part.

142
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:34,640
Here?

143
00:08:35,320 --> 00:08:37,280
Oh, you have to fix this first.

144
00:08:42,940 --> 00:08:44,120
Ah.

145
00:08:44,420 --> 00:08:45,520
Right here?

146
00:09:06,380 --> 00:09:07,860
Keep teaching me...

147
00:09:29,060 --> 00:09:30,660
What are you looking at? Look at this.

148
00:09:31,920 --> 00:09:32,700
Well, your cheek...

149
00:09:32,700 --> 00:09:34,040
is much nicer to look at.

150
00:09:45,720 --> 00:09:46,780
Stop staring.

151
00:09:47,280 --> 00:09:48,620
You won't finish in time.

152
00:09:49,220 --> 00:09:49,800
You...

153
00:09:49,800 --> 00:09:51,100
stop dodging me for once.

154
00:09:52,920 --> 00:09:54,480
Or I won't get to kiss you in time.

155
00:10:01,800 --> 00:10:02,720
Hey.

156
00:10:04,280 --> 00:10:05,900
Were you peeking at me?

157
00:10:22,720 --> 00:10:23,260
Uh...

158
00:10:23,260 --> 00:10:24,520
Right there.

159
00:10:25,640 --> 00:10:26,460
Got it.

160
00:10:28,200 --> 00:10:28,620
Hold on.

161
00:10:28,880 --> 00:10:29,740
I'll go...

162
00:10:29,740 --> 00:10:32,120
refill some bitter coffee first.

163
00:10:39,560 --> 00:10:40,160
Yeah.

164
00:10:40,820 --> 00:10:42,180
This scent smells good too.

165
00:10:45,320 --> 00:10:45,920
Nice.

166
00:10:48,800 --> 00:10:49,400
Nice.

167
00:10:49,980 --> 00:10:51,280
Very nice indeed.

168
00:11:12,680 --> 00:11:14,580
The coffee's probably gone cold.

169
00:11:16,720 --> 00:11:17,160
Oh.

170
00:11:20,560 --> 00:11:22,420
I think I need to talk to you, Dan.

171
00:11:22,420 --> 00:11:23,520
About what?

172
00:11:24,760 --> 00:11:26,920
As your boss...

173
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:28,740
seeing you like this...

174
00:11:29,260 --> 00:11:31,720
I think it might affect your work.

175
00:11:34,480 --> 00:11:36,040
But statistically speaking...

176
00:11:36,040 --> 00:11:37,560
I've never failed, Boss.

177
00:11:40,760 --> 00:11:41,840
Forget about the boss stuff.

178
00:11:41,840 --> 00:11:43,340
Seriously, Dan...

179
00:11:43,340 --> 00:11:45,100
as a friend...

180
00:11:45,740 --> 00:11:48,120
seeing you like this, I'm really worried.

181
00:11:53,760 --> 00:11:54,540
It's him.

182
00:11:56,240 --> 00:11:57,980
The kid you brought in.

183
00:11:58,680 --> 00:12:01,100
The one I told you about.

184
00:12:01,400 --> 00:12:03,680
The kid who broke your heart, Dan?

185
00:12:04,680 --> 00:12:07,600
The one I thought I had run far away from...

186
00:12:08,060 --> 00:12:09,800
but I ran into him again.

187
00:12:10,760 --> 00:12:12,720
Can you handle it, buddy?

188
00:12:13,020 --> 00:12:14,220
I can't.

189
00:12:16,680 --> 00:12:18,200
I don't want to be near him anymore.

190
00:12:19,600 --> 00:12:20,220
Can you...

191
00:12:20,220 --> 00:12:22,260
help keep him away from me?

192
00:12:23,000 --> 00:12:25,240
Keep him away? How do I help?

193
00:12:27,820 --> 00:12:29,160
Pretend to be your boyfriend or something?

194
00:12:29,160 --> 00:12:29,860
Like...

195
00:12:29,860 --> 00:12:31,760
like this? Like this, buddy?

196
00:12:31,760 --> 00:12:33,580
Wow, you're so old-fashioned.

197
00:12:34,160 --> 00:12:36,300
Who would believe you and I are boyfriends?

198
00:12:40,920 --> 00:12:42,240
Didn't you say you were hitting on P'Best?

199
00:12:42,240 --> 00:12:43,640
I am hitting on him.

200
00:12:44,880 --> 00:12:46,040
If they say they're boyfriends...

201
00:12:46,040 --> 00:12:47,420
would anyone believe it, P'?

202
00:12:48,600 --> 00:12:49,920
At first, I didn't believe it either.

203
00:12:49,920 --> 00:12:51,020
But now...

204
00:12:53,480 --> 00:12:54,540
Don't hype it up, man!

